                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="rc-section rc-dark o_colored_level" data-name="How It Works">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="text-center mb-5">
                        <span class="rc-eyebrow">How it works</span>
                        <h2 class="rc-title">From first call to <em>last plate</em></h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-4">
                        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="rc-step"><div class="rc-num">01</div><h4>Tell us your plan</h4><p>Share the date, guest count and budget through Plan My Event or a quick call.</p></div></div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="rc-step"><div class="rc-num">02</div><h4>Taste the menu</h4><p>Visit our restaurant for a free tasting and fine-tune every dish with our chef.</p></div></div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="rc-step"><div class="rc-num">03</div><h4>We set it up</h4><p>Décor, counters, crockery and staff arrive on time, fully briefed by your planner.</p></div></div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="rc-step"><div class="rc-num">04</div><h4>You celebrate</h4><p>Relax with your guests while we serve, clear up and leave the venue spotless.</p></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
